{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもお菓子のみ！ｗ\nngng６ループできるやないかい！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吹雪の中帰ってきました\n北海道楽しかった～！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/111203_191701.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑北海道野菜カレー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天候の良くない中\nイベント来てくださったかた\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいてませんか＞＜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌は寒かったけど\n寒い事を忘れるくらい楽しくて(*^^*)\n北海道からも\n応援してくださる方々がいる\nってほんとに嬉しい(´｀*)\n絶対また行きます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やきそば弁当は\nまだ食べてないので\n今度いただきまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースで好きなキャラは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n好きなのいっぱいいるんですけど\nロー、ペボ、チョッパーあたりが\n大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推し変についてどう思う？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田推しになるなら許す！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しないでアイドルと話すには？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田なら気軽に話せるとおもうので\n練習に使ってください＼^^／←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/111204_023101.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！もう１個！\nファンレくださったかた\nありがとうございます\nしっかり読ませていただいてます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な宝物です。\n墓場まで持ってきます(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな"}],"source":"archive"}